text.description:
{Mountain Giant Heart}

The heart left by the giant of the Mountain Giant Grotto; it has no power of its own. Offer it at the Jotun Altar in a Norse town (the artifact is taken), and the kingdom gains for good: level 1-4 dwellings in Norse towns +1 weekly growth.
Once all four giant hearts are offered, level 5-7 dwellings in Norse towns get +1 weekly growth more (Ragnarok).

{Rock Giant Heart}

The heart left by the giant of the Rock Giant Lair; it has no power of its own. Offer it at the Jotun Altar in a Norse town (the artifact is taken), and the kingdom gains for good: troops defending a Norse town (with a Fort) get Defense +2.
Once all four giant hearts are offered, level 5-7 dwellings in Norse towns get +1 weekly growth more (Ragnarok).

{Frost Giant Heart}

The heart left by the giant of the Frost Giant Ice Cave; it has no power of its own. Offer it at the Jotun Altar in a Norse town (the artifact is taken), and the kingdom gains for good: Norse troops take 25% less water spell damage, and Norse heroes' water spells deal +10% damage.
Once all four giant hearts are offered, level 5-7 dwellings in Norse towns get +1 weekly growth more (Ragnarok).

{Fire Giant Heart}

The heart left by the giant of the Fire Giant Lava Rift; it has no power of its own. Offer it at the Jotun Altar in a Norse town (the artifact is taken), and the kingdom gains for good: Norse troops Attack +1, and Norse heroes' fire spells deal +10% damage.
Once all four giant hearts are offered, level 5-7 dwellings in Norse towns get +1 weekly growth more (Ragnarok).

{Gungnir}

Attack +3, your troops deal +5% damage.

A component of the Asgard Hoard.

{Gambanteinn}

Spell Power +3, Knowledge +2.

A component of the Asgard Hoard.

{Ullr's Bow}

Your shooters suffer no range penalty, scouting radius +1.

A component of the Asgard Hoard.

{Nibelung Ring}

Provides 750 gold per day.

A component of the Asgard Hoard.

{Fenrir's Fetters}

Enemy troops Speed -1.

A component of the Asgard Hoard.

{Dwarven Horseshoes}

Land movement +300.

A component of the Asgard Hoard.
